      "message": "so there is just one bus one can opt in? what if there is a driver that needs more than 1 bus? I know this is what we want in which case it needs to go in vendor side logic, IMO",
      "revId": "54b6cba3effd5a65350d2a2bb7f404eb048c1b17",
