      "side": 1,
      "message": "sorry, I have replied from my personal account before. copy/pasting the same comment here with my corp account.\n\nIn vendor code, we can implement the compatibility check\n\n```\ndiff --git a/drivers/iommu/iommu.c b/drivers/iommu/iommu.c\nindex fc7286d801db..a4da6d111586 100644\n--- a/drivers/iommu/iommu.c\n+++ b/drivers/iommu/iommu.c\n@@ -235,6 +235,11 @@ int iommu_device_register(struct iommu_device *iommu,\n        spin_unlock(\u0026iommu_device_lock);\n\n        for (int i \u003d 0; i \u003c ARRAY_SIZE(iommu_buses) \u0026\u0026 !err; i++) {\n+               bool skip \u003d false;\n+\n+               trace_android_vh_bus_iommu_probe(iommu, iommu_buses[i], \u0026skip);\n+               if (skip)\n+                       continue;\n                iommu_buses[i]-\u003eiommu_ops \u003d ops;\n                err \u003d bus_iommu_probe(iommu_buses[i]);\n        }\n```",
